-- SEVERAL SQL STATEMENTS --------------------------------------- main.kl  K1604

This SQL literal holds more than one statement (a `;` outside quotes). Each `Sql` value is exactly one statement.

3│     let q = sql"DELETE FROM users WHERE name = {name}; DELETE FROM notes"
               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

Help: Split it into one `sql"..."` per statement, and run them inside a transaction if they must succeed together.

Learn more: kalam explain K1604
